# Testing Patterns

## Framework & Configuration

- pytest with `pytest-asyncio` (mode=auto), `pytest-cov` for coverage
- Config in `backend/pyproject.toml` under `[tool.pytest.ini_options]`
- Run: `cd backend && pytest tests/unit/` (556 tests, ~5min)
- Coverage report included automatically via `--cov` flags in pyproject.toml

